WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600 line:78%
Step 1 · Open kara.bahuynh.com/tv on the TV. It shows the room code and a QR code.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.500 line:78%
Step 2 · Scan the QR code with a phone to join the room. Nothing to install.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500 line:78%
Step 3 · Type a song name and search.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500 line:78%
Tap + to add it to the queue and enter who is singing.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:30.900 line:78%
Step 4 · Tap the TV to start. The MC introduces the song and the singer.

6
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:38.400 line:78%
Step 5 · The whole room sings along to the lyrics on the TV and sends reactions from their phones.

7
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:46.400 line:78%
Step 6 · When the song ends, the MC scores the room.
